title: Campaigning
new-page: true
view-if: not rubicon or campaigning_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; campaigning_timer += 2 if rubicon
is-card: true
card-image: img/wahlplakat_mitglied.jpg
frequency: 100
tags: party_affairs

= Campaigning

Whether or not we are in an electoral campaign, the party is always trying to broaden its voter base. Who should we focus our campaign efforts on?

- @youth: Young people, especially in larger cities.
- @urban: The urban workers, white and blue collar workers.
- @rural: The rural workers, who haven't supported us in the past.
- @upper: The upper class, managers and enterpreneurs, who dislike us.
- @east: The workers in the Eastern states, our greatest stronghold.
- @root: We either don't want to or cannot campaign right now.
- @easy_discard

@youth
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; youth_linke += ((social_media+3+solid+(10-social_moderation))/2)*(1-dissent); beweli_strength += ((social_media+4+(10-social_moderation))/3); pragmatist_strength -= 1; wagenknecht_left_progress += 0.5;

We have increased our campaigning among the youth. 

@urban
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: urban_linke += ((newspapers+(social_media/4))+3)*(1-dissent); resources -= 1;  

We have increased our campaigning among the urban workers.

@rural
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: rural_linke += ((newspapers+social_moderation)/2.5)*(1-dissent); resources -= 1; social_moderation += 0.5; pragmatist_strength += 2; beweli_strength -= 1; emali_strength -= 1;

We have increased our campaigning among the rural workers.

@upper
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: upper_linke += (4+econ_moderation)/4*(1-dissent); resources -= 1; pragmatist_strength += 1; econ_moderation += 0.5; beweli_dissent += 3; emali_dissent += 3; oldleft_dissent += 3; spd_relation += 1;

We have increased our campaigning among the upper class.

@east
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: east_linke += ((newspapers+social_moderation+(10-foreign_moderation))/3)*(1-dissent); resources -= 1; oldleft_strength += 3; pragmatist_strength += 2;

We have increased our campaigning in the Eastern states.
